      "coefficients": [
        1.0,
        0.12,
        0.04,
        0.04
      ],
      "rationale": "This small uniform repair provides an inexpensive evolving reference with an actually used distance-two feature. Frontier count divided by residual count is dimensionless; multiplying by the seconds-valued degree score preserves score units. It measures possible release beyond immediate neighbors, without asserting that a count repairs the supplied witness. The modest feature adjustment and 16-node domain emphasize completed repairs rather than elaborate scoring. Nearby parameter and policy mutations remain subject to signed complete-proposal gain and charged CPU."
    },
