      "rationale": "The witness places changed edges at distance two and beyond, motivating incident pressure on the exact frontier. Frontier reward share and incident-pressure share are dimensionless and bounded for nonnegative weights. This replaces the old uncompressed incident-weight adjustment with a modest perturbation of a seconds-valued score. Three-contact blocked repairs and a smaller 24-node cap limit work. Exchange gains count in the complete proposal objective, while ranking and exchange contributions remain separately observable."
