      "rationale": "Compatible residual topology can change while root statistics remain unchanged. One greedy completion measures retained feasible reward, and one induced-edge aggregate measures its surrounding conflict pressure. Both seconds-valued features become dimensionless shares before modifying the score. Compared with the own round-one resource recipe, this removes the cover query, reduces destruction and caps the domain at 24. Resource-boundary anchoring and RCL provide a distinct search role; neither feature is an exact conditional optimum or a performance certificate."
