      "rationale": "With undirected deduplicated edges, incident minimum-weight sum minus internal minimum-weight sum measures crossing pressure. The nonnegative score expression accommodates numerical roundoff; it never clips scheduling gains. Separate crossing and internal shares inspect structure beyond the unchanged root-neighbor Q/T statistics. This is the only 64-node recipe, allowing the witness-sized domain without completion queries. Greedy rebuilding and reduced destruction limit additional work. Whether its coordinates actually separate retained certified contexts must be checked under the corrected archive representation."
